
Lamba koya: ['plus:'] yana-nufin: ['+'].
Lamba idan: ['+'] yi: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x maʼaunin-lamba.
	(currency = ['euros']) gaskiya: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (kai plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars maʼauni: ['dollars'].
euros maʼauni: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Fitarwa rubuta: money, sabon-layi.
